      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça fera 47 900 <U+E300> !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 1,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C700610020006600650072006100200034003700200039003000300020E300002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça fera 48 700 <U+E300> !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 1,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 6588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C700610020006600650072006100200034003800200037003000300020E300002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça fera 49 700 <U+E300> !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 1,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 6628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C700610020006600650072006100200034003900200037003000300020E300002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ouah, t’es trop fort<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe en calcul mental !\nJ’reviendrai acheter mes boissons ici, c’est sûr !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 6668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmmm... T’es sûr<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe du prix, là... ? J’ai pas l’temps\nd’vérifier, mais fais gaffe, la prochaine fois, OK ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 6864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me revoilà ! Merci de m’avoir remplacée !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 7084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00650020007200650076006F0069006C00E0002000210020004D00650072006300690020006400650020006D201900610076006F00690072002000720065006D0070006C0061006300E900650020002100100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, ça s’est bien passé ? Laisse-moi jeter\nun œil au stock et à ce que t’as encaissé...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 7176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quoi ? Mais qu’est-ce qui s’est passé ?\nTu mérites le rang Z des caissi<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̂erères !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 7368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmmm... T’es pas fait<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe pour la vente, toi.\nJe me trompe ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 7548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D006D006D002E002E002E0020005420190065007300200070006100730020006600610069007400100003110000FF0100006500200070006F007500720020006C0061002000760065006E00740065002C00200074006F0069002E000A004A00650020006D0065002000740072006F006D007000650020003F00100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je t’en ai peut-être un peu trop demandé...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 7684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007420190065006E00200061006900200070006500750074002D00EA00740072006500200075006E0020007000650075002000740072006F0070002000640065006D0061006E006400E9002E002E002E00100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas mal. Ça arrive à tout le monde de faire\ndes erreurs, donc je t’en veux pas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 7780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est pas parfait, mais tu t’es plutôt bien\ndébrouillé<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 7948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00432019006500730074002000700061007300200070006100720066006100690074002C0020006D0061006900730020007400750020007420190065007300200070006C0075007400F400740020006200690065006E000A006400E900620072006F00750069006C006C00E900100003110000FF010000650020002100100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aucune erreur ?! Ça alors, j’hallucine !\nTu veux me remplacer ou quoi ?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 8084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous avez reçu une prime de <U+0010><U+0003>Ȅ<U+0002>  <U+E300> !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 8240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006100760065007A00200072006500E7007500200075006E00650020007000720069006D00650020006400650020001000030204000200200020E300002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En tout cas, heureusement que t’étais là pour\nme remplacer, car mon Cryodo était à deux doigts<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde transformer ma maison en congélateur !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 8316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci beaucoup ! J’espère que tu reviendras\nme voir... en tant que client<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe, cette fois !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 8604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voulez-vous un rappel du prix des produits ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 8800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0075006C0065007A002D0076006F0075007300200075006E002000720061007000700065006C002000640075002000700072006900780020006400650073002000700072006F006400750069007400730020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 8892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750069002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non.",
